---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const timeline = [
  { year: '2018', text: 'Starts producing electronic music out of pure curiosity.' },
  { year: '2020', text: 'First breakthrough with recognition in the progressive house community.' },
  { year: '2022', text: '"Addicted To You" — first release, self-released.' },
  { year: '2023', text: '"Not What I Need" released on Soulz Music Group.' },
  {
    year: '2024',
    text: '"Embrace The Night" (Ensis Records) and "I\'m Broken" (Future House Cloud) released.',
  },
  {
    year: '2025',
    text: 'First official remix, "Morgen Untergehen" for Ann-Cathrin, followed by "Reminds Me Of You" on FeelQ Recordings.',
  },
];

const jsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'ProfilePage',
  mainEntity: {
    '@type': 'Person',
    name: 'Ozee',
    jobTitle: 'Electronic Music Producer',
    nationality: 'German',
    genre: ['Progressive House', 'Festival EDM'],
  },
};
---

<Layout
  title="About Ozee"
  description="Learn about Ozee, a German progressive house and festival EDM producer active since 2018, with releases on labels including Interplay Records, Stardust Records, FeelQ Recordings and more."
  image="/images/press/press-photo-1.jpeg"
  imageAlt="Ozee, progressive house and festival EDM producer, press photo"
  type="profile"
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-40 pb-20">
    <div
      class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10"
      style="background: radial-gradient(55% 45% at 50% 0%, rgba(124,92,255,0.18), transparent 70%);"
    >
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="reveal text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white/50 mb-4">About</p>
        <h1 class="reveal text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">The Story of Ozee</h1>
        <p class="reveal text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
          Ozee is an electronic music producer from Germany who began shaping his sound back in
          2018.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal aspect-[4/5] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10">
        <img
          src="/images/press/press-photo-1.jpeg"
          alt="Portrait of Ozee, German progressive house and festival EDM producer"
          width="1204"
          height="1600"
          loading="eager"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
    <h2 class="reveal text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-6">From Curiosity to Craft</h2>
    <div class="reveal space-y-6 text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-lg">
      <p>
        What started as pure curiosity quickly grew into a passion, fueled by the influence of
        artists like Martin Garrix, Alesso, Hardwell, and many more. From the beginning, Ozee set
        out to create music that doesn't just follow a formula but combines different influences
        from all kinds of music, resulting in tracks that are both powerful and unique.
      </p>
      <p>
        His first breakthrough arrived in 2020 with first recognition in the progressive
        community, opening the door to bigger stages. Since then, Ozee has released music across
        the scene on labels big and small &mdash; from <a href="/releases/not-what-i-need/" class="underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-brand hover:text-brand-soft transition-colors">Not What I Need</a> on
        Soulz Music Group in 2023, to two standout 2024 tracks: <a href="/releases/embrace-the-night/" class="underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-brand hover:text-brand-soft transition-colors">Embrace The Night</a> on
        Ensis Records and <a href="/releases/im-broken/" class="underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-brand hover:text-brand-soft transition-colors">I'm Broken</a> on
        Future House Cloud.
      </p>
      <p>
        2025 marked a defining year, as Ozee delivered his first official remix for German
        singer-songwriter Ann-Cathrin with <a href="/releases/morgen-untergehen/" class="underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-brand hover:text-brand-soft transition-colors">Morgen Untergehen</a> and
        joined FeelQ Recordings with <a href="/releases/reminds-me-of-you/" class="underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-brand hover:text-brand-soft transition-colors">Reminds Me Of You</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        With each track, Ozee continues to evolve, merging emotion, energy, and innovation into a
        sound that reflects his journey and passion for electronic music.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
      <h2 class="reveal text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-10">Timeline</h2>
      <ol class="reveal relative border-l border-white/15 space-y-10 pl-8">
        {
          timeline.map((item) => (
            <li>
              <span class="absolute -left-[7px] mt-1.5 h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-brand" />
              <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-white/40 mb-1">{item.year}</p>
              <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed">{item.text}</p>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 text-center">
    <h2 class="reveal text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Sound &amp; Influences</h2>
    <p class="reveal text-white/70 leading-relaxed mb-8">
      Ozee's sound draws on the melodic, festival-ready progressive house pioneered by artists
      like Martin Garrix, Alesso and Hardwell &mdash; reshaped through his own blend of emotion,
      energy and genre-crossing influences.
    </p>
    <a
      href="/releases/"
      class="reveal btn-primary"
    >
      Explore the Releases
    </a>
  </section>
</Layout>
